  "display_title": "Sleeping With the Enemy",
  "description": "When Shin Yiyeon, CEO of Sini Entertainment, chances across Yeo Taejin, she’s convinced she’s struck gold. With his perfect visuals and aloof personality, Taejin practically oozes star potential. Little does Yiyeon know, however… Taejin is actually the CEO of Jin Entertainment, Sini’s rival company! Intrigued by Yiyeon’s ability to spot talent, Taejin infiltrates Sini to find out the key to her success. Will he succeed in stealing her secrets? Or will it be his heart that is stolen instead…?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
